    "chunk_index": 0,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "b52541c3b4cc305aab738c4a691b9db0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 419,
    "chunk_text": "Wish children always remain children\n\nThe late Indian Prime Minister Jawaharlal Nehru once remarked, \u201cWish children always remain children.\u201d This was when he saw them happily playing in his garden.\n\nWhat he must have meant was the innocence of children, no racism, greed or corruption, and the freedom to enjoy.\n\nIf we can practise some of the qualities of our childhood, what a better country and world it will be."
  },
