    "chunk_text": "Singer Finance joins hands with Ceylon Automobile Importers Association to promote responsible motoring\n\nSinger Finance has come on board as the \u2018Main Sponsor\u2019 of the \u2018Ceylon Automobile Importers Motor Rally 2026\u2019, reaffirming its commitment to supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s automotive industry while promoting responsible motoring and accessible vehicle\n\nOrganised by the Ceylon Automobile Importers Association, the Motor Rally brings together Sri Lanka\u2019s leading vehicle importers to celebrate the country\u2019s passion for automobiles while creating greater awareness of road safety, responsible driving practices and the positive contribution of the automotive sector to the national economy.\n\nTrue to its role as \u2018Your Number 1 Leasing Partner\u2019, Singer Finance extends its involvement beyond event sponsorship by delivering trusted financial solutions that empower customers and drive the growth of the country\u2019s mobility ecosystem.\n\nSinger Finance Managing Director Thushan Amarasuriya said, \u201cSINGER FINANCE is delighted to partner with the Ceylon Automobile Importers Motor Rally, an event that reflects the enduring passion for automobiles and the continued growth of Sri Lanka\u2019s motoring community. This partnership aligns perfectly with our promise of being \u2018Your Number 1 Leasing Partner\u2019, as we continue to empower more Sri Lankans to achieve their vehicle ownership aspirations through trusted financial solutions.\u201d"
