    "chunk_size_bytes": 477,
    "chunk_text": "MP Hizbullah appears before Bribery Commission\n\nColombo, August 13 (Daily Mirror) \u2014 Member of Parliament M. L. A. M. Hizbullah appeared before the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption today to provide a statement in connection with an ongoing inquiry into his assets and liabilities.\n\nHizbullah arrived at the Commission premises following a formal notice requiring him to appear before investigators and provide information relating to the inquiry."
