    "chunk_text": "Train services delayed on Main Line following breakdown\n\nColombo, Aug. 13 (Daily Mirror) - All train services operating on Sri Lanka\u2019s Main Line have been delayed following a train breakdown between the Ambepussa and Alawwa railway stations.\n\nSri Lanka Railways said the disruption was caused by the breakdown of a train operating on the line.\n\nRailway authorities are taking steps to restore normal services, while delays are expected to continue until the issue is resolved."
