    "md5": "b44c6daad25d31a216776a3be76bb08a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1714,
    "chunk_text": "AB Securitas takes Gold at National Business Excellence Awards 2026\n\nAB Securitas, Sri Lanka\u2019s trusted leader in security and cash management solutions, has been awarded the Gold Award in the Security and Technical Services \u2013 Large Category at the National Business Excellence Awards (NBEA) 2026, organised by the National Chamber of Commerce of Sri Lanka.\n\nWith over 30 years of industry expertise, pioneering certifications, and a strong commitment to innovation, AB Securitas delivers integrated security and cash management solutions to many of Sri Lanka\u2019s most trusted organisations across multiple industry sectors. Combining advanced technology, operational excellence, and a highly trained workforce, the company continues to set industry benchmarks while delivering unmatched safety, reliability, and customer confidence.\n\nAB Securitas has consistently led the industry through its unwavering commitment to quality and excellence. It was the first Sri Lankan security company to obtain ISO certification and the first in the industry to receive the National Quality Award for Business Excellence in 2015. The company is also the only Sri Lankan security provider certified with ISO 45001:2018 for Occupational Health and Safety Management, reaffirming its commitment to employee wellbeing, operational excellence, and stakeholder confidence.\n\nFurther strengthening its leadership within the industry, AB Securitas has been a founding member of the Sri Lanka Security Services Providers Association (SLASSPA) since 2004 and an active member of the Industrial Security Foundation (ISF) since 2009, contributing to the advancement of professional standards within Sri Lanka\u2019s private security sector."
  },
