    "chunk_text": "Niti represents organisational propriety, behavioural correctness, and formal institutional rules. Nyaya, on the other hand, is concerned with the actual lives that people can lead and the elimination of manifest injustices in the real world.\n\nTrue judicial reform must break this cycle, moving us past the empty rituals of Niti and finally delivering the livable reality of Nyaya to our people.\u201d"
