    "chunk_text": "Corporates can access this through Mark&Comm as a fully managed service. Clients do not need to operate the enterprise platform themselves; we handle the real-time monitoring, data extraction, and strategic analysis. We also offer a seven-day trial period, giving potential clients the opportunity to see exactly what the tool can do and understand if it provides specific, actionable insights before making a long-term commitment.\n\nWe recently worked with an organization facing online allegations related to an environmental issue. While the conversation was not widespread, our monitoring detected it gaining traction among advocacy groups and independent media. We identified what was driving the discussion, the key amplifiers, and the reputational risks. Based on these insights, we advised the client to align their internal and legal teams and prepare a holding statement. The real value was not just tracking the noise, but identifying the emerging risk early and giving leadership the context needed to make informed decisions before the situation became a crisis.\n\nQ If a corporation invested in social listening, how could they measure the ROI?\n\nROI is measured through strategic growth driven by our insights. When a corporate campaign goes live, we gauge where the audience stood beforehand, analyze their real-time reactions, and formulate a communication strategy based on those emotions. Seeing tangible positive growth in brand equity and public sentiment from that tailored communication is the direct return on investment."
