    "md5": "98c9cd6522a0b7a3330c04e3cac22394",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1908,
    "chunk_text": "Abans brings \u2018Living Just Right with LG AI\u2019 to Colombo City Centre\n\nAbans, in partnership with LG Electronics, brought \u2018Living Just Right with LG AI\u2019 to Colombo City Centre, giving the Sri Lankan consumers an opportunity to experience how thoughtful technology can make everyday living simpler, more comfortable and more personal.\n\nHeld from August 12 to 16, at the Colombo City Centre Atrium, the activation introduced visitors to LG\u2019s vision of Affectionate Intelligence, a human-centred approach to technology designed to understand people, adapt to their needs and fit naturally into their everyday lives.\n\nRather than making life more complicated, LG AI is designed to work quietly in the background, helping make everyday routines more convenient and enjoyable.\n\nWhile traditional artificial intelligence is often associated with technology that can process information, automate tasks and respond to commands, LG\u2019s Affectionate Intelligence takes a more human approach. It goes beyond simply responding to instructions by considering the context of everyday life and adapting to individual needs.\n\nThe idea is simple: technology should work around people, helping create greater comfort and convenience without adding complexity to daily routines. What once seemed like a glimpse of the future is now becoming part of everyday life, with AI already helping people live more comfortably, conveniently and intuitively.\n\nAt the heart of the activation was an interactive LG AI Home, created around familiar everyday living spaces. Instead of presenting AI as something distant or difficult to understand, the experience demonstrated how LG AI can already be part of everyday life. Through practical home environments and real-life use cases, visitors could see how LG products can respond to different needs and routines, bringing greater comfort, convenience and peace of mind into the home."
  },
