    "description": "SLBC NextGen: Investing in next generation of Sri Lankan business leadership in UAE",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/SLBC-NextGen-Investing-in-next-generation-of-Sri-Lankan-business-leadership-in-UAE/34-796083",
    "lang": "en",
