    "language": "en",
    "md5": "f329dc2be705838a9dd0cdf284f6518c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1803,
    "chunk_text": "LOLC Life Assurance introduces new Family Takaful product\n\nLOLC Life Assurance, through its dedicated Takaful arm Al-Falaah Takaful Life, has introduced the LOLC Life Family Takaful Deferred Maturity product, a Shariah-compliant long-term financial solution designed to help individuals safeguard their loved ones, strengthen their financial resilience and prepare responsibly for the future.\n\nThe solution is based on the principles of mutual cooperation, shared responsibility and ethical investment.\n\nIt was officially introduced at a dedicated business launch held in the Eastern region, bringing together the company\u2019s sales force and business partners to mark the commencement of its market rollout.\n\nDeveloped in response to the growing demand for financial solutions that combine Family Takaful coverage with long-term financial planning, the solution enables the participants to make contributions under a Shariah-compliant Takaful arrangement while receiving financial support in the event of covered contingencies together with the opportunity for potential fund growth through Shariah-compliant investments. Investment returns are subject to actual fund performance and the applicable terms and conditions of the Takaful certificate.\n\nLOLC Life Family Takaful is available to individuals aged 18 to 60 years. It offers flexible contribution payment periods of three, five, seven or 10 years, with Takaful certificate terms ranging from 10 to 40 years, enabling the participants to select an arrangement that aligns with their long-term financial objectives.\n\nThe participants may also make additional top-up contributions, subject to the applicable product terms and conditions, providing greater flexibility to support their long-term financial goals and potential fund growth objectives."
