    "description": "\u2018This is the time\u2019 to enter  Sri Lanka: CB Governor tells investors",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/This-is-the-time-to-enter-Sri-Lanka-CB-Governor-tells-investors/245-348316",
