    "description": "\u201cCyclone Ditwah exposed critical structural gaps in  Sri Lanka\u2019s early warning  architecture\u201d - Prof. Amaratunga -",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Cyclone-Ditwah-exposed-critical-structural-gaps-in-Sri-Lankas-early-warning-architecture-Prof-Amaratunga/334-348330",
