    "description": "Beyond tax collection: Can Sri Lanka use tax policy to build a solar-powered economy?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-tax-collection-Can-Sri-Lanka-use-tax-policy-to-build-a-solar-powered-economy/4-796209",
    "lang": "en",
