    "md5": "b1a1f8367bb6f0069bebaf03ae4e43e9",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1912,
    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank honoured with dual wins\n\nTriumphs with dual recognition as Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Bank for Customer Experience and Best Bank for SMEs\n\nSeylan Bank has been honoured with dual wins at Euromoney Awards for Excellence 2026, a prestigious recognition, as Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Bank for Customer Experience and Best Bank for SMEs, two of the most coveted country titles.\n\nEuromoney is a leading international financial publication and market intelligence provider focused on global banking, capital markets and institutional finance.\n\nRecognition from Euromoney reaffirms Seylan Bank\u2019s commitment towards superior customer experience and small and medium enterprise (SME) empowerment.\n\nHaving previously won the Best Bank for Customer Experience at Euromoney Awards 2025, Seylan Bank has retained the title for a second consecutive year, reaffirming the dependability of its specialist support and digital platforms to help individuals and businesses amplify growth and revenue.\n\nThe twofold Euromoney accolades demonstrate international recognition of consistent care for bank customers and the depth of the bank\u2019s dedicated support for the SMEs islandwide, validating years of investment in digital innovation and accessible banking.\n\nDirector and CEO Ramesh Jayasekara said, \u201cThe dual recognition is a proud milestone for Seylan Bank, reaffirming our drive towards more meaningful and customer\u2011centric banking services. Being named Sri Lanka\u2019s Best Bank for Customer Experience for the second consecutive year and the award for Best Bank for SMEs, validates our continued investment in people and systems that deliver tangible value.\u201d\n\nSeylan Bank\u2019s SME award is a significant achievement for a bank firmly established as a catalyst for SME growth in Sri Lanka. The recognition is driven by substantial efforts to empower the SME sector, resulting in the growth of Seylan\u2019s SME loan portfolio."
