    "chunk_size_bytes": 1522,
    "chunk_text": "SolarRay Energy will support customers with a comprehensive suite of services including engineering solutions at the interface between power assets and utility networks, feasibility studies, and Engineering, Procurement, and Construction Management (EPCM) advisory services, as well as operation and maintenance services to ensure optimal system performance.\n\nFounded in 2016 by Managing Director Chamil Silva and Executive Director Waruni Ranawaka, SolarRay Energy has evolved from a traditional solar installer into an established renewable energy, electrical engineering, and project management company serving Sri Lanka\u2019s residential, commercial, industrial, and utility sectors. The company delivers end-to-end capabilities spanning site assessments, grid interface engineering, and EPCM advisory services, while actively expanding its portfolio to include next-generation Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS) and intelligent energy-management solutions.\n\nGrounded in a technical approach that prioritises engineering quality, safety, grid compliance, and long-term lifecycle performance over initial equipment costs, SolarRay Energy focuses on delivering robust, system-wide energy solutions tailored to both individual households and complex commercial operations.\n\nThrough partnerships such as this, Commercial Bank continues to make sustainable energy solutions more accessible and affordable, reinforcing its commitment to driving the adoption of green technologies among Sri Lankan households and businesses."
