    "chunk_text": "\u201cEmploying persons with disabilities is not an act of philanthropy. It is a sound investment in individuals who are committed to learning the skills of the trade and who often excel in the workplace,\u201d Yohan said. \u201cToo often, persons with disabilities face barriers not because of a lack of ability, but because of limited access and limited opportunity. When employers create inclusive workplaces, they help remove these barriers and allow individuals to contribute their full potential to the national economy.\u201d\n\nThirteen apparel companies signed the voluntary pledge at the ceremony: Brandix Apparel PVT LTD, Filotex Lanka (Pvt) Ltd, Hirdaramani International Exports (Pvt) Ltd, Inqube Global (Pvt) Ltd, Maliban Wovens (Pvt) Ltd, Martex M F G (Pvt) Limited, Miami Clothing (Pvt) Ltd, Original Apparel (Pvt) Ltd, Q Collection (Pvt) Ltd, Sumithra Garments (Private) Limited, Sun Queen Apparel (Pvt) Ltd, Vogue Tex (Pvt) Ltd, and Winterquilts (Pvt) Ltd.\n\nThe ceremony concluded with the formal handover of signed commitment letters from participating companies, followed by a vote of thanks and a networking reception."
