    "num": "dailymirrorlk-60ce1d6d",
    "date_str": "2026-08-19",
    "description": "Why Sri Lanka should decriminalise homosexuality \u2014 irrespective of GSP+",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Why-Sri-Lanka-should-decriminalise-homosexuality-irrespective-of-GSP/172-348436",
