    "md5": "20553f2a5a5aeaef11fdb0c34ccbbf74",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1721,
    "chunk_text": "Amana Bank celebrates 15 years with 15% savings at 150+ merchant outlets\n\nFrom left:\u00a0 Muhara Razak - Product Manager- Card offers and Marketing , Azim Rali- Assistant Vice President - Marketing & Corporate Communications , Arshad Jamaldeen - Assistant Vice President - Digital Banking & Cards, Siddeeque Akbar - Vice President Retail Banking & Marketing\n\nAmana Bank, in celebration of its 15th anniversary, has partnered with over 150 merchant outlets to offer its customers with a 15 percent saving on their Debit Card spend. The promotion offers customers savings across a wide range of categories, including fashion, retail, dining, healthcare, household essentials, children\u2019s products, and hospitality.\n\nApart from the discount offers, as part of the anniversary celebration, the Bank has also launched a 15-day 15 percent cashback challenge, where the first 150 customers to swipe their card on 15 separate days during August 2026 with a minimum cumulative spend of Rs. 50,000 will be rewarded with a 15 percent cashback up to Rs. 15,000.\n\nThe promotion brings together an extensive portfolio of merchant including leading apparel and fashion brands such as Cool Planet, Hameedia, Signature, Envoy Mansion, Crocodile, SWX, Avirate, Jezza, TFS, Stripes and Checks, Be Desi and The Factory Outlet; family, children\u2019s and household retailers including The Kids Warehouse, House of Gifts and Elegant Charms; popular dining and culinary destinations such as Sheraton Colombo, Courtyard by Marriott, Mandarina Colombo, Arabian Knights, Indian Summer Restaurant, Khalid\u2019s Biriyani, KFC, Chambers, Carnival Ice Cream, Sponge, The Cake Factory and Hill Food Street; and Retail Supermarket including Softlogic Glomark."
  },
