    "description": "BOC Launches C Flex Corporate to Expand Digital Cash Management Services",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/BOC-Launches-C-Flex-Corporate-to-Expand-Digital-Cash-Management-Services/273-348474",
    "lang": "en",
