    "chunk_text": "Brushes and rollers delivered a 78 percent QoQ revenue growth, expanded its outlet reach by 12 percent to more than 3,000 outlets and further strengthened its market-leading position through a 3 percent increase in market share.\n\nIn Bangladesh, revenue increased by 33 percent in BDT terms, with the industrial segment growing 31 percent, the retail segment growing 40 percent, Coat-Ex sales increasing by 61 percent and ACL gross profit improving by one percent. The Maldives also recorded a strong growth during the quarter, with revenue increasing by 624 percent QoQ. Mirotone New Zealand recorded a 10 percent QoQ revenue growth in NZD terms."
