    "description": "14 Lamborghinis take new route through Sri Lanka due to strait of Hormuz closure",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/14-Lamborghinis-take-new-route-through-Sri-Lanka-due-to-strait-of-Hormuz-closure/108-348513",
