    "chunk_text": "WCIC PRATHIBHABHISHEKA 2026 \u2013 Applications Open\n\nThe 5th edition of the WCIC Women Entrepreneur Awards invites women entrepreneurs across Sri Lanka and the SAARC region to showcase their achievements and compete for national recognition, including the coveted Woman Entrepreneur of the Year 2026 title. Applications are now open. Visit www.wcicsl.lk for details. Pix by Kithsiri De Mel"
