    "chunk_text": "Indonesia marks 81st Independence Day\n\nIndonesian Ambassador to Sri Lanka H.E. Dewi Gustina Tobing hosted a National Day Reception at the Indonesian Embassy in Colombo yesterday (20) to mark the 81st Anniversary of the Independence Day of the Republic of Indonesia. Pix by Nimalsiri Edirisinghe"
