    "chunk_text": "Hashan Tillakaratne appointed Sri Lanka batting coach\n\nSri Lanka Cricket (SLC) has appointed former Sri Lanka cricketer Hashan Tillakaratne as the Batting Coach of the Senior Men\u2019s Program.\n\nTillakaratne will be based at SLC\u2019s National High Performance Center and will work with national players as part of the Senior Men\u2019s Program.\n\nThe former World Cup winner has previously served as the batting coach of the Sri Lanka men\u2019s national team and as head coach of the Sri Lanka women\u2019s national team. He has also served as head coach of the Bangladesh Women\u2019s National Team.\n\nTillakaratne represented Sri Lanka from 1989 to 2003, featuring in 83 Test matches and 200 One-Day Internationals.\n\nHe accumulated more than 8,200 international runs across the two formats during his playing career."
