    "md5": "1bb3f3c3d0cd5bf984f4a0022411b216",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1630,
    "chunk_text": "Abans joins Dialog Pay merchant ecosystem\n\nFrom left: Dialog Axiata Group Chief Operating Officer Lim Li San, Dialog Finance Business Officer Sachini De Silva, Abans Senior Brand Manager Samith Fernando, and Head of Finance Nandun Wickramasighe\n\nDialog Axiata PLC has announced its partnership with Abans, enabling customers to make secure LankaQR payments using Dialog Pay across all Abans showrooms island-wide. The partnership extends digital payment convenience to one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading retail brands, with a network of over 400 outlets, while rewarding customers with complimentary Dialog data on eligible LankaQR transactions.\n\nCustomers can now use Dialog Pay to purchase a wide range of products, including consumer electronics, home appliances, mobile devices, IT products, furniture, kitchen appliances and other lifestyle solutions available at Abans showrooms nationwide. The partnership provides customers with a secure and convenient way to pay while enjoying greater flexibility when shopping for everyday essentials and high-value purchases alike.\n\nAbans Head of Finance Nandun Wickramasighe said, \u201dAt Abans, we are committed to continuously enhancing the shopping experience by offering our customers greater convenience, choice and flexibility. Our partnership with Dialog Pay introduces another trusted digital payment option across our retail network, making it easier for customers to shop the products they need. By bringing together two trusted brands, we are helping accelerate the adoption of digital payments while supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s transition towards a more digitally enabled economy.\u201d"
  },
