    "chunk_text": "Deputy Fisheries, Aquatic and Ocean Resources Minister Rathna Gamage, Industries\u2019 Ministry Boatbuilding Sector Chairman Indra Kaushal Rajapaksha, representatives of the Export Development Board and other Government and industry officials attended the opening.\n\nFor Neil Marine, the new facility is also intended to reinforce the company\u2019s role in an industry with potential for greater export diversification. The company plans to use the Dikovita site as a production base for boats serving both domestic and overseas markets."
