    "chunk_size_bytes": 823,
    "chunk_text": "EU, Sri Lanka discuss stronger economic ties as Ambassador departs\n\nSri Lanka and the European Union (EU) discussed further strengthening bilateral cooperation and economic relations during a meeting between European Union Ambassador to Sri Lanka and the Maldives Carmen Moreno and Finance and Planning Deputy Minister Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando.\n\nThe Finance Ministry said the meeting, held ahead of Ambassador Moreno\u2019s departure from Sri Lanka, also provided an opportunity to reflect on longstanding cooperation between the two sides.\n\nAmbassador Moreno and Dr. Fernando exchanged views on avenues to deepen Sri Lanka-EU economic relations and broader bilateral cooperation. Dr. Fernando also expressed appreciation for Ambassador Moreno\u2019s contribution towards strengthening Sri Lanka-EU relations during her tenure."
