    "chunk_text": "Located at 42 Chilaw Road, Negombo, the new branch occupies more than 4,000 square feet and has been designed as a modern, spacious destination that combines medical care, aesthetics, and wellness. The facility features more than 10 treatment rooms, dedicated therapy rooms and a Moroccan steam room. For Dr Sarah, the expansion is about more than establishing another location. It is about bringing professional, doctor-led aesthetic care closer to clients outside Colombo. \u201cIt is a very proud and special moment for me as we officially open our third 360 Skin Clinic branch. Having a location in Negombo has been a long-standing dream, and I am incredibly proud to see it become a reality. More importantly, this allows us to bring the standard of care we have established in Colombo closer to clients in Negombo and the surrounding areas,\u201d said Dr Sarah.\n\nThe Negombo branch brings together medical dermatology, advanced aesthetics and modern technology, offering personalised care for concerns including acne, pigmentation and signs of ageing. Its services include advanced facials and skincare, hair treatments, microneedling, laser treatments, as well as minimally invasive and non-invasive aesthetic procedures.\n\nThe clinic also offers a range of beauty and self-care services, including manicures, pedicures, nail art and lip blush, creating a comprehensive destination for skin health, aesthetics and personal care.\n\nUnder the guidance of Dr. Sarah Fazy, the Negombo operation is led by Dr. Evanjana Silva, Medical Officer at 360 Skin Clinic \u2013 Negombo, and a team of trained professionals. Treatments are carried out according to established protocols, with modern equipment and technology supporting the clinic\u2019s focus on quality and patient safety."
