    "description": "Hayleys Advantis-National Council for Road Safety launch \u2018100 for 100\u2019 rider safety initiative",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business/Hayleys-Advantis-National-Council-for-Road-Safety-launch-100-for-100-rider-safety-initiative/215-348643",
    "lang": "en",
