    "chunk_size_bytes": 762,
    "chunk_text": "Final farewell to Nanda Malini\n\nThe funeral of veteran Sri Lankan singer Dr. Nanda Malini was held at the Borella General Cemetery yesterday (22).\n\nHer remains were placed at the Nanda Malini Sangeetha Ashram (Music Academy) at No. 30, Vijayaba Mawatha, Nawala Road, Nugegoda, where members of the public gathered to pay their final respects.\n\nFollowing the funeral rites and Pansukula ceremony, the funeral procession carrying her remains left the Sangeetha Ashram at around 3.30 p.m. and proceeded to the Borella General Cemetery via Parliament Road and Rajagiriya.\n\nThe funeral was attended by family members, fellow artistes, dignitaries and a large number of members of the public who gathered to bid farewell to one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most celebrated voices."
