    "chunk_text": "Hand grenade thrown at house in Borella\n\nColombo, Aug. 23 (Daily Mirror) - A hand grenade was thrown at a house in 141 Watta on Leslie Ranagala Mawatha, Borella, in an apparent attack linked to an ongoing dispute between organized crime groups, police said.\n\nThe targeted residence is reportedly linked to an associate of organized crime figure Kavishka Madushan Abeywickrama, alias \u201cWanathe Chathu,\u201d who was recently arrested in Dubai.\n\nThe grenade was thrown at the house during the morning hours but failed to detonate..\n\nCCTV footage from the surrounding area has reportedly captured a suspect arriving on a motorcycle and throwing the grenade at the residence before fleeing the scene.\n\nPolice have launched an investigation to identify the suspect and determine the motive behind the attack, while security has been strengthened in the surrounding area."
