    "chunk_text": "The company also recorded an improvement in its underwriting position, with the underwriting loss reducing to approximately Rs. 92.4 million from Rs. 231.9 million in the corresponding period of 2025.\n\nAt the same time, Fitch Ratings has affirmed People\u2019s Insurance PLC\u2019s \u2018A(lka)\u2019 National Insurer Financial Strength (IFS) Rating, with a Stable Outlook. Further, People\u2019s Insurance continued to maintain its stable Capital Adequacy Ratio, supporting the Company\u2019s capacity to pursue future growth while meeting its regulatory and policyholder obligations.\n\nWith total GWP growth substantially ahead of the general insurance industry, Motor and Non-Motor businesses both recording strong expansion and profitability improving significantly, People\u2019s Insurance enters the second half of 2026 with strengthened financial fundamentals and an improved market position."
