    "md5": "cb578a18dcb5b7d2c515ff6d72f4fc8c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1075,
    "chunk_text": "Supported by expert-led sessions, mentorship and strategic guidance, the participating start-ups enhanced their customer validation, value propositions, scalability and investor engagement capabilities, gaining the knowledge and confidence needed to build sustainable, investment-ready ventures.\n\nSLASSCOM Vice Chair 1 Haridhu Abeygoonaratne added, \u201cXcellerate equips the founders with the tools, mentorship and global perspective needed to shape the future of Sri Lanka\u2019s technology sector.\u201d\n\nThe programme was supported by nVentures as the Acceleration Partner, in collaboration with the Royal Norwegian Embassy.\n\nnVentures Managing Partner Chalinda Abeykoon said, \u201cFewer than one percent of start-ups ever raise venture capital. The difference is rarely the pitch. It\u2019s whether the founders have built enough evidence for investors to develop conviction. Xcellerate helps the founders strengthen that evidence through customer validation, commercial fundamentals and investor readiness, giving them a stronger chance of raising capital when the time is right.\u201d"
