    "date_str": "2026-08-24",
    "description": "JR, Judiciary and Political Elimination of Sirimavo",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/JR-Judiciary-and-Political-Elimination-of-Sirimavo/172-348729",
    "lang": "en",
