    "description": "FJ&G de Saram launches  U.L. Kadurugamuwa Legacy Series",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/FJ-G-de-Saram-launches-U-L-Kadurugamuwa-Legacy-Series/34-796434",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
