    "description": "Cabinet approves urgent reconstruction of NIFS premises in Hanthana",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Cabinet-approves-urgent-reconstruction-of-NIFS-premises-in-Hanthana/56-796441",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
